  "operation": "Explicit existing rectangles/pivots, real standing-body reference per page, no grid slicing, pixel edit, mirroring, deformation or generated interpolation.",
  "limits": [
    "Candidate definition only. Shared registry was not edited. Native duel transitions and fighter scale must be reviewed by root before release.",
    "Six existing OpenAI source pages and 44 drawings are reused; zero new images or drawings generated.",
    "12 oriented action sequences are represented by 24 engine phase clips. No complete moveset, certified official 1:1 fidelity or campaign chronicle is claimed.",
    "Guard-rifle is excluded because its much shorter rifle breaks continuity with idle/attacks.",
    "Left idle keeps only source columns 1/3; columns 2/4 change cannon mounting position. Both facing cycles last 80 ticks, without interpolation.",
    "Walking, jumps, guards/blockstun, crouch/air attacks, technique, throws, victims and finishers remain outside this proposal."
  ],
